# messaging/grapple_outcomes.yaml store snapshot
# category counts at time of writing: advancements=20 degradations=8 reversals=3 escapes=1 holds=5 striking_apex=1 gradients=4
# dimensions: category x key x role. Triad categories (advancements/degradations/reversals/escapes/holds)
# and gradients BOTH use role in {actor,actee,observer}: M4b-1 merged the two authored vocabularies
# (controller/controlled/observers and self/partner/observers). striking_apex is single-speaker (no role).
# Each tuple: fresh cooldowns map + fresh SequencePicker via PickTemplate, then narration.Substitute
# with fixed stand-ins Controller/Controlled.

advancements|backstanding_to_background|actor => You haul down on the seatbelt, kick one heel behind their knee, and drag both of you to the mat. Hooks in.
advancements|backstanding_to_background|actee => Controller bites down on the seatbelt and sweeps your knee out. You land hard on your back with them coiled behind you.
advancements|backstanding_to_background|observer => Controller sweeps Controlled's knee and drags them to the mat, sinking hooks on the way down.
advancements|clinch_to_background|actor => You pummel inside and spin behind them, both hands locking on the waist. Their back is yours before they can pivot.
advancements|clinch_to_background|actee => Controller spins inside your guard and suddenly they're behind you, arms cinched around your waist.
advancements|clinch_to_background|observer => Controller pummels inside and spins behind Controlled, locking both hands at the waist.
advancements|clinch_to_backstanding|actor => You body-lock from behind, lifting slightly to break their base, then drag them back against you. They're upright but your hooks are hunting.
advancements|clinch_to_backstanding|actee => A duck-under steals your hip. Controller rises behind you, forearms boxing your ribs. You're standing but helpless.
advancements|clinch_to_backstanding|observer => Controller ducks under and rises behind Controlled in a rear clinch.
advancements|clinch_to_mount|actor => You wrench the underhook, drive forward, and ride them down into mount.
advancements|clinch_to_mount|actee => Controller wrenches the underhook and rides you down. The ceiling spins overhead. They're mounted on your chest.
advancements|clinch_to_mount|observer => Controller wrenches an underhook and rides Controlled down into mount.
advancements|clinch_to_sidecontrol|actor => You overbalance them with a hip throw feint, catch them on the way down, and land in side control.
advancements|clinch_to_sidecontrol|actee => Controller levers your wrist outward and your hip buckles and you land hard. Their weight pins your upper chest before you can roll.
advancements|clinch_to_sidecontrol|observer => Controller leverages a wrist and sweeps Controlled to the mat, settling into side control.
advancements|guard_to_background|actor => They posture to escape the guard; you take the back in the scramble: seatbelt on, hooks threading in.
advancements|guard_to_background|actee => You posture to escape Controller's guard and they follow you up, slapping on the seatbelt. Back mount.
advancements|guard_to_background|observer => Controlled postures to escape; Controller takes the back with a seatbelt and hooks.
advancements|guard_to_mount|actor => You trap the arm, bridge the hips, and roll them into mount and the arm-trap sweep put you on top.
advancements|guard_to_mount|actee => The arm trap locks your elbow and the hip bridge sends you rolling. Controller is mounted on your chest.
advancements|guard_to_mount|observer => Controller arm-trap bridges Controlled and sweeps to mount.
advancements|guard_to_sidecontrol|actor => You off-balance them with a hip bump, catch the arm on the way over, and come up in side control.
advancements|guard_to_sidecontrol|actee => The hip bump catches you leaning; you tip and Controller comes up over you into side control.
advancements|guard_to_sidecontrol|observer => Controller hip-bumps Controlled and sweeps to side control.
advancements|halfguard_to_background|actor => They roll to prevent the pass. You abandon the leg, slap the seatbelt over their shoulder, and drag them to their back.
advancements|halfguard_to_background|actee => You roll to block Controller's pass but you expose your back. They wrap the seatbelt and the hooks land.
advancements|halfguard_to_background|observer => Controlled rolls to block the pass; Controller takes the back from half guard.
advancements|halfguard_to_mount|actor => You flatten them out, free the trapped leg, and step directly over into mount without pausing in side control.
advancements|halfguard_to_mount|actee => Controller frees their leg and steps directly into mount. No pause, no warning. You're mounted.
advancements|halfguard_to_mount|observer => Controller frees the trapped leg from Controlled's half guard and steps straight into mount.
advancements|halfguard_to_sidecontrol|actor => You hip-escape, free the trapped leg with a knee-slice, and clear the half guard into side control.
advancements|halfguard_to_sidecontrol|actee => Controller knee-slices through your half guard. The leg pops free and they sprawl into side control.
advancements|halfguard_to_sidecontrol|observer => Controller knee-slices through Controlled's half guard and settles in side control.
advancements|kob_to_background|actor => They roll away from the knee to find breathing room. You jump the roll and land on their back, already hunting hooks.
advancements|kob_to_background|actee => You roll to get away from Controller's knee, but they flow with you and end up at your back. Hooks dig into your hips.
advancements|kob_to_background|observer => Controlled rolls to escape the knee; Controller flows to their back and sinks hooks.
advancements|kob_to_mount|actor => You slide your knee forward off the belly and step the foot through into mount without them finding a frame.
advancements|kob_to_mount|actee => You bridge against Controller's knee and they slide it forward, straight into mount, heavier and worse.
advancements|kob_to_mount|observer => Controller slides the knee off Controlled's belly and settles into full mount.
advancements|mount_to_background|actor => They turn to shield their face from your elbow. You take the gift Seatbelt over the shoulder, hooks in, back mount.
advancements|mount_to_background|actee => You roll away from Controller's elbows but you hand them your back. They slap in a seatbelt and your position worsens.
advancements|mount_to_background|observer => Controlled rolls to avoid strikes; Controller rides the roll and takes back mount.
advancements|ns_to_background|actor => You spin fully, hips over their face, and drive forward. They roll to stay oriented and hand you the back.
advancements|ns_to_background|actee => Controller drives into a north-south choke position. You roll to escape and wake up with them at your back.
advancements|ns_to_background|observer => Controlled rolls to avoid a north-south choke setup; Controller takes the back.
advancements|ns_to_mount|actor => You walk your hips forward along their body line and swing your legs over in one smooth pivot into mount.
advancements|ns_to_mount|actee => Controller walks forward from north-south and swings into mount. You're pinned before you can lift your hips.
advancements|ns_to_mount|observer => Controller walks forward from north-south and pivots into full mount on Controlled.
advancements|ns_to_sidecontrol|actor => You rotate ninety degrees, framing the shoulder, and drop your hip across their chest: side control.
advancements|ns_to_sidecontrol|actee => Controller pivots out of north-south and drops their hip across your chest. You're in side control before you can frame.
advancements|ns_to_sidecontrol|observer => Controller rotates from north-south and drops into side control on Controlled.
advancements|sidecontrol_to_background|actor => They roll to their knees under the pressure. You ride them up, slap on the seatbelt, and drag them back down with hooks in.
advancements|sidecontrol_to_background|actee => You try to come up to your knees but Controller rides the turtle and wraps over your shoulder. Seatbelt. Their hooks dig in.
advancements|sidecontrol_to_background|observer => Controlled turtles; Controller rides to their back and sinks both hooks.
advancements|sidecontrol_to_mount|actor => You walk your knee up their hip line, step across the belly, and settle your weight into full mount.
advancements|sidecontrol_to_mount|actee => Controller walks their knee across your belly. You scramble but their hips are already past your guard. Mounted.
advancements|sidecontrol_to_mount|observer => Controller knee-slides across Controlled's torso into full mount.
advancements|turtle_to_background|actor => You drive a seatbelt grip over the far shoulder, kick one heel across their hip, and roll them onto their back, hooks in.
advancements|turtle_to_background|actee => Controller clamps the seatbelt across your far shoulder and rolls you over. You land on your back, hooks already in.
advancements|turtle_to_background|observer => Controller seatbelts Controlled from turtle and rolls them to back mount.
degradations|background_to_mount|actor => Controlled turns into you and they roll face-up and pull you forward. You're in mount now, on top but no longer at the back.
degradations|background_to_mount|actee => You roll toward Controller's hook-side, drag the top hook down, and pull them forward. Back mount becomes mount. You're face-up now with Controller on top.
degradations|background_to_mount|observer => Controlled rolls toward Controller's hook-side and pulls them forward; back mount becomes mount.
degradations|backstanding_to_clinch|actor => Controlled pivots hard and strips your waist grip. Suddenly you're facing each other in a clinch instead of riding their back.
degradations|backstanding_to_clinch|actee => You drop your chin, peel Controller's seatbelt hand, and pivot hard. Their grip peels away and you're face-to-face in a clinch.
degradations|backstanding_to_clinch|observer => Controlled peels Controller's seatbelt grip and pivots to face them; back control gives way to a clinch.
degradations|crucifix_to_background|actor => Controlled rolls the trapped arm free and the crucifix unravels. You're left with back mount instead.
degradations|crucifix_to_background|actee => You force your elbow down, drive the arm inside Controller's grip, and break the figure-four. The crucifix falls apart and you're back to back mount.
degradations|crucifix_to_background|observer => Controlled forces the elbow inside Controller's grip and breaks the arm trap; crucifix falls back to back mount.
degradations|halfguard_to_guard|actor => Controlled wiggles the trapped leg out and closes full guard. Your half-guard pin is gone, with both legs locked around your waist.
degradations|halfguard_to_guard|actee => You shrimp hard on the pinned side, create a little space, and drag the knee through. Half guard becomes full guard.
degradations|halfguard_to_guard|observer => Controlled shrimps and drags the trapped knee through; half guard becomes full guard on Controller.
degradations|kob_to_sidecontrol|actor => Controlled shrimps sideways and knocks your knee off their belly. You drop your hip back down into side control.
degradations|kob_to_sidecontrol|actee => You shrimp into Controller and knock the knee off your belly and they drop back into side control. Uncomfortable, but better.
degradations|kob_to_sidecontrol|observer => Controlled shrimps into Controller and bucks the knee off their belly; Controller drops to side control.
degradations|mount_to_sidecontrol|actor => Controlled bridges hard and hip-escapes and your mount slides off into side control.
degradations|mount_to_sidecontrol|actee => You bridge hard and shrimp the hip free and Controller's mount slides off you and into side control.
degradations|mount_to_sidecontrol|observer => Controlled bridges and hip-escapes from under Controller; the mount slides to side control.
degradations|ns_to_sidecontrol|actor => Controlled turns their hips out and frames your thigh away. North-south loses grip and you slide to side control.
degradations|ns_to_sidecontrol|actee => You shrimp your hips sideways and frame Controller's thigh out. Their north-south hold breaks; they slide to side control.
degradations|ns_to_sidecontrol|observer => Controlled shrimps the hips and frames Controller's thigh away; north-south degrades to side control.
degradations|sidecontrol_to_halfguard|actor => Controlled threads a knee inside and recovers half guard. Your side control compresses to a half-guard pin.
degradations|sidecontrol_to_halfguard|actee => You elbow-frame Controller's shoulder and work your near knee inside. It threads through and you close the half guard.
degradations|sidecontrol_to_halfguard|observer => Controlled elbow-frames and threads the near knee inside; side control becomes half guard.
reversals|background_reverse|actor => You lose the hooks. Controlled peels your top hook and spins into you. They land in mount before you can recover.
reversals|background_reverse|actee => You peel the top hook, rotate hard into Controller, and sit on their chest in mount. Back mount is gone.
reversals|background_reverse|observer => Controlled peels Controller's hook and spins inside, landing in mount: back mount reversed.
reversals|generic_reverse|actor => Controlled finds the leverage you missed. The position flips and suddenly they're the one in control.
reversals|generic_reverse|actee => You find the angle and force the reversal and Controller is now the one pinned.
reversals|generic_reverse|observer => Controlled reverses the position on Controller, claiming control.
reversals|mount_reverse|actor => Controlled bridges and you tumble forward and they roll up between your legs and now you're in their guard.
reversals|mount_reverse|actee => You bridge hard, post on the temple, and roll Controller between your legs: full guard, you're on top.
reversals|mount_reverse|observer => Controlled bridges and rolls Controller forward into a guard reversal as top and bottom flip.
escapes|generic_escape|actor => Controlled explodes free and they're back on their feet before you can grab again.
escapes|generic_escape|actee => You explode through the gap and scramble to your feet, free of Controller's grip at last.
escapes|generic_escape|observer => Controlled explodes free of Controller and scrambles back to their feet.
holds|backstanding_hold|actor => You stay glued to Controlled's back, hands fighting for the over-under.
holds|backstanding_hold|actee => Controller stays glued to your back. You hand-fight the over-under.
holds|backstanding_hold|observer => Controller stays glued to Controlled's back, hand-fighting.
holds|clinch_hold|actor => You and Controlled grind in the clinch with wrist fights and head-position grunts.
holds|clinch_hold|actee => You and Controller grind in the clinch as your wrists battle for control.
holds|clinch_hold|observer => Controller and Controlled grind in the clinch, neither giving ground.
holds|ground_hold_generic|actor => You posture down and ride out Controlled's squirming.
holds|ground_hold_generic|actee => Controller's weight settles harder. You burn cardio trying to find leverage.
holds|ground_hold_generic|observer => Controller rides out Controlled's squirming.
holds|guard_hold|actor => You break Controlled's posture down with your legs and they grind for an opening.
holds|guard_hold|actee => Controller's legs pry and snap. You can't post your base.
holds|guard_hold|observer => Controller works the guard, breaking Controlled's posture.
holds|turtle_hold|actor => Controlled curls tighter. You hand-fight for an opening to the back.
holds|turtle_hold|actee => You curl tighter. Controller pulls at your wrists.
holds|turtle_hold|observer => Controller hand-fights Controlled, looking for an opening to the back.
striking_apex|mount_strike_flavor|(single-speaker) => You ride high in mount and rain elbows down.
gradients|lower_boundary_down|actor => Pressure crashes down and Controller smothers your movement and you're fully controlled.
gradients|lower_boundary_down|actee => Your pressure drives through; Controlled can't resist and the position fully locks in.
gradients|lower_boundary_down|observer => Controller drives pressure home and Controlled can no longer resist: full control established.
gradients|lower_boundary_up|actor => You create space: a bridge and a hip-escape breaks Controller's weight off you.
gradients|lower_boundary_up|actee => Controlled bridges and creates space and your dominant control slips into a scramble.
gradients|lower_boundary_up|observer => Controlled bridges and scrambles back from Controller's control and the position evens out.
gradients|upper_boundary_down|actor => Your control slips and Controlled squirms free of the lock you had.
gradients|upper_boundary_down|actee => Controller's dominance slips. You feel space opening where there was none.
gradients|upper_boundary_down|observer => Controller loses their controlling grip on Controlled; the exchange evens out.
gradients|upper_boundary_up|actor => You feel the position click: your weight settles right and you assert full control.
gradients|upper_boundary_up|actee => Controller settles their weight and the position locks against you and they're in control.
gradients|upper_boundary_up|observer => Controller establishes dominance over Controlled and control settles in their favor.

# EMPTY CASE: PickTemplate on a nil pool -> fallback sentinel, not ""
(nil-pool)|n/a|n/a => "(grapple messaging missing template)"
